{{also|Appendix:Variations of "ot"}}
==Russian==

===Prefix===
'''от-''', {{lang|ru|[[ото-]]}} (ot-, oto-)

# {{context|used with verbs|lang=ru}} [[away]] [[from]]
#:* {{l|ru|идти́}} — ''to go''
#:* {{l|ru|отойти}} {{l|ru|от}} — ''to go away from''

====Usage notes====
* Only use от- when the subject moves away from the object of interest, still remaining within a sight range.
: ''Я отошла от неё.''
::I walked away from her. (I was standing next to her, but then took a few steps away from her, still being able to see her in the same room or space.)
: ''Я {{lang|ru|[[уйти|ушла]]}} от неё.''
::I walked away from her. (I was in the same room or space with her, but then left her where she was and went to a different place.)

